Supply tracking / continuous differential equivalent / simulation only
Vcmd cmd 0 PWL(0 650 .1 650 .3 100 .5 100 .7 650 1 650)
Rlag cmd actual 1
Clag actual 0 0.01
.options reltol=1e-8 abstol=1e-14 method=gear
Bdrive drive 0 V=6.5*sin(2*pi*20*time)*v(actual)/v(actual)
Bideal ideal 0 V=6.5*sin(2*pi*20*time)
Rsrca drive pa 10709.3992554037
Lpa pa 0 150.0
Lsa sa 0 0.126023944549464
Ka Lpa Lsa 0.999973332977768
Rseca sa oa .2
Rloada oa 0 8
Rcorea pa 0 100000.0
Cpria pa 0 1e-10
Rsrcb ideal pb 10709.3992554037
Lpb pb 0 150.0
Lsb sb 0 0.126023944549464
Kb Lpb Lsb 0.999973332977768
Rsecb sb ob .2
Rloadb ob 0 8
Rcoreb pb 0 100000.0
Cprib pb 0 1e-10
.save v(cmd) v(actual) v(drive) v(ideal) v(oa) v(ob) i(Lpa) i(Lsa) i(Lpb) i(Lsb)
.tran 10u 1.0 0 10u
.end
